WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.105
♪

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.239 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: DID WOKE POLICIES

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.841 line:78%
COST KIDS THOUSANDS OF DOLLARS

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.876 line:78%
IN SCHOLARSHIPS?

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:12.112 line:78%
VIRGINIA IS NOW THE EPICENTER OF

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:14.114 line:78%
THIS DAMAGING EQUITY CRUSADE.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.548 line:78%
AT LEAST 13 SCHOOLS THERE ARE

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:18.718 line:78%
BEING ACCUSED OF WITHHOLDING

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:20.420 line:78%
MERIT AWARDS FROM TOP STUDENTS

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.720 line:78%
AFTER THE COLLEGE APPLICATION

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.056 line:78%
CYCLE.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.524 line:78%
IT WAS REPORTEDLY DONE TO AVOID

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:26.626 line:78%
HURT FEELINGS, BUT THE PARENTS

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:29.062 line:78%
SAY THE MOVE CHEATED THEIR KIDS

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:30.697 line:78%
OUT OF THOUSANDS OF DOLLARS

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:32.032 line:78%
WORTH OF SCHOLARSHIPS.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:35.602 line:78%
GOVERNOR YOUNGKIN IS OUTRAGED,

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:36.569 line:78%
SAYING, QUOTE, THEY HAVE A

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:39.639 line:78%
MANIACAL FOCUS ON EQUAL OUTCOMES

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:41.074 line:78%
FOR ALL STUDENTS AT ALL COSTS,

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:41.808 line:78%
AND HIS ATTORNEY GENERAL IS

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:45.879 line:78%
VOWING TO INVESTIGATE.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:47.347 line:78%
&gt;&gt; ONE OF THEIR DIRECTIVE TO THE

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:50.583 line:78%
SCHOOL DISTRICT WAS EQUAL

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:54.120 line:78%
OUTCOMES NO MATTER WHAT, EVEN IF

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:55.989 line:78%
IT MEANS TREATING SOME STUDENTS,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:59.626 line:78%
QUOTE, PURPOSESY EQUALLY.

00:00:56.656 --> 00:01:01.628 line:78%
ONE MOTHER SAYS, MY DAUGHTER

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:03.963 line:78%
HAS WORKED HARD, AND MAY NOT GO

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:05.265 line:78%
TO THE SCHOOL OF HER DREAM

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:07.300 line:78%
BECAUSE SHE'S KOREAN AMERICAN.

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.368 line:78%
THAT GOES AGAINST EVERYTHING WE

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.470 line:78%
BELIEVE IN THIS COUNTRY.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:11.404 line:78%
THAT'S WHY WE HAVE THIS

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.172 line:78%
INVESTIGATION.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.507 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: DANA, YOU TALKED

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:16.009 line:78%
ABOUT THE DRIP, DRIP, DRIP.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.510 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: THIS ONE TOO.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:19.946 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: WE HEARD ABOUT ONE

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:22.515 line:78%
SCHOOL, THEN IT WAS AT THAT

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:24.084 line:78%
SCHOOL, AND HEARING MORE AND

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:25.985 line:78%
MORE ABOUT OTHER SCHOOLS.

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:28.888 line:78%
SOUNDS LIKE IT WAS AN ORGANIZED

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:30.056 line:78%
EFFORT TO KEEP THE INFORMATION

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.591 line:78%
AWAY FROM KIDS.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.692 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: THE PARENTS HAPPENED TO

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.360 line:78%
SEE THE LETTER FROM THE NATIONAL

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:36.162 line:78%
MERIT SCHOLARS ASSOCIATION ON

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:36.729 line:78%
THEIR CHILD'S DESK AT HOME

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.564 line:78%
RANDOMLY.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.232 line:78%
WHAT'S THIS?

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.833 line:78%
OH, WE JUST GOT IT.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.668 line:78%
OH, OKAY.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:44.771 line:78%
THAT'S WHEN THE PARENT CALLS.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:45.371 line:78%
THEY SAY, OH, THIS WAS A UNIQUE

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:46.673 line:78%
CIRCUMSTANCE.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:48.975 line:78%
IT'S AN ABERRATION.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:50.276 line:78%
THIS IS NOT ANYTHING HAPPENING

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.945 line:78%
ANYWHERE ELSE.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.046 line:78%
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL YOU JUST

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:55.448 line:78%
SAW, HE RAN HIS CAMPAIGN, WHEN

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:57.584 line:78%
HE WAS RUNNING FOR OFFICE, ON

00:01:55.548 --> 00:02:00.787 line:78%
ROOTING OUT THIS WOKE NONSENSE

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:02.021 line:78%
THAT PRIORITIZES EQUITY AND

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.690 line:78%
RACIAL SEGREGATION OVER MERIT.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:04.924 line:78%
SO HE SAID, I'M GOING TO LOOK

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.860 line:78%
INTO THIS.

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:07.360 line:78%
WELL, IT'S ONLY BEEN ABOUT 10

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.561 line:78%
DAYS.

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:08.962 line:78%
NOW WE KNOW THAT 13 SCHOOLS WERE

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:11.397 line:78%
DOING THIS.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:13.133 line:78%
I WANT TO KNOW IF IT'S JUST IN

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:15.935 line:78%
VIRGINIA OR A NATIONWIDE THING.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:17.403 line:78%
IS IT, LIKE, A SECRET BAT SIGNAL

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.771 line:78%
THAT GOES OUT TO THE SCHOOLS,

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:20.807 line:78%
LIKE DON'T PUT IT IN WRITING,

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:23.109 line:78%
BUT LET'S ALL MAKE SURE THAT WE

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:25.011 line:78%
DON'T UPSET ANYBODY BY MAKING

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:26.579 line:78%
SURE THEY DON'T FEEL BAD IF THEY

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.113 line:78%
DON'T GET A NATIONAL MERIT

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.148 line:78%
SCHOLARSHIP.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.581 line:78%
BUT THIS IS A CIVIL RIGHTS

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:29.816 line:78%
ISSUE.

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.416 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT HE'S GOING FOR ON

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:32.185 line:78%
THIS ONE.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:33.453 line:78%
THE OTHER THING IS, THERE'S A

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:34.921 line:78%
GROUP CALLED PARENTS DEFENDING

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:36.923 line:78%
EDUCATION, AND THEY'VE DEVELOPED

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:39.792 line:78%
A MASSIVE DATABASE TO FIGURE OUT

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:41.261 line:78%
WHERE THE SCHOOLS USING PUBLIC

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.562 line:78%
TAXPAYER DOLLARS TO HIRE WOKE

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:44.230 line:78%
CONSULTANTS, WHERE IT WAS GOING.

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.298 line:78%
THEY FOUND ABOUT $20 MILLION IN

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:47.967 line:78%
CONTRACTS NATIONWIDE.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:48.368 line:78%
A HUGE AMOUNT OF IT WAS SPENT IN

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.236 line:78%
VIRGINIA.

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:50.770 line:78%
HE'S DOING WHAT HE CAMPAIGNED

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:52.672 line:78%
ON.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.274 line:78%
WE'LL SEE HOW IT TURNS OUT.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.608 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: BRIAN, THE SCHOOLS

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:57.443 line:78%
INITIALLY SAID, YOU KNOW, IT'S

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:58.244 line:78%
BECAUSE OF HUMAN ERROR, IT WAS A

00:02:57.544 --> 00:03:00.280 line:78%
UNIQUE SITUATION.

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:02.515 line:78%
AND NOW WE'VE GOT THE ATTORNEY

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:04.250 line:78%
GENERAL, HE'S GOING TO SUE FOR

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:06.352 line:78%
UNLAWFUL DISCRIMINATION, A

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:06.719 line:78%
VIOLATION OF THE CIVIL RIGHTS

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:07.587 line:78%
ACT.

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.422 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Brian: YOU WOULD KNOW BETTER,

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:10.790 line:78%
BUT IF YOU'RE AN INDIVIDUAL

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:12.625 line:78%
THAT'S SUPPOSED TO GET A

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:14.194 line:78%
SCHOLARSHIP, YOU GET A MERIT

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:16.796 line:78%
AWARD, THESE INDIVIDUAL FAMILIES

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:17.931 line:78%
SHOULD BE ABLE TO SUE.

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:21.367 line:78%
YOUNGKIN SLAMMED THE DISTRICT

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:21.801 line:78%
FOR HIRING A $450,000 A YEAR

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:25.104 line:78%
EQUITY COACH.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:25.672 line:78%
THIS STARTED WITH THE

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:27.907 line:78%
VALEDICTORIANS.

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:29.576 line:78%
THEY DECIDED NOT TO HAVE ONE,

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:32.879 line:78%
BECAUSE WE DON'T WANT EVERYBODY

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:34.380 line:78%
ELSE TO FEEL BAD FOR NOT WORKING

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:36.416 line:78%
AS HARD OR BEING AS SMART.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:38.685 line:78%
THAT WAS NOTHING COMPARED TO

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:40.019 line:78%
THIS, BUT WE'VE GOT TO SMART.

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:43.423 line:78%
THE ASIAN AMERICANS SUED TO GET

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:46.759 line:78%
RID OF AFFIRMATIVE ACTION, AND

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:49.128 line:78%
THEY'RE GETTING SCREWED BECAUSE

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:50.363 line:78%
THEY OUTWORK EVERYONE ELSE.

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:53.166 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: WHAT ABOUT A KID WHO

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:57.036 line:78%
HAS A DREAM, CAN RUN FASTER,

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:57.337 line:78%
WORKS HARDER, TO ACHIEVE THAT

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:58.004 line:78%
DREAM?

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:58.471 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: ABSOLUTELY.

00:03:58.104 --> 00:03:59.772 line:78%
THIS IS UNFAIR.

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:03.276 line:78%
IT'S CREEPY.

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:04.377 line:78%
IT MAY BE CRIMINAL WHAT THEY DID

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:05.745 line:78%
INTENTIONALLY DENYING

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:06.779 line:78%
NOTIFICATION OF WINNING A MERIT

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:08.948 line:78%
SCHOLARSHIP SO YOU COULDN'T PUT

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:10.516 line:78%
IT ON YOUR RESUME, SO YOU DON'T

00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:10.850 line:78%
GET IN THE COLLEGE OF YOUR

00:04:10.617 --> 00:04:13.253 line:78%
CHOICE.

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:15.054 line:78%
TENS OF THOUSANDS OF MANY ASIAN

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:16.256 line:78%
AMERICAN KIDS AFFECTED BY THIS.

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:18.558 line:78%
THIS IS ROTTEN.

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:22.295 line:78%
I THINK THAT -- I BELIEVE THIS

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:24.030 line:78%
IS WORSE THAN THE SCANDAL,

00:04:22.395 --> 00:04:25.198 line:78%
PEOPLE PAYING TO BE ON THE FAKE

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:28.968 line:78%
ROWING TEAM AND ALL THAT.

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:29.335 line:78%
I THINK THIS WILL BE A BIGGER

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:30.236 line:78%
STORY.

00:04:29.502 --> 00:04:31.437 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Brian: IT SHOULD BE.

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:33.172 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: THIS IS AWFUL WHAT

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:33.973 line:78%
THEY'VE DONE TO THESE CHILDREN.

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:35.642 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: MOST OF THE KIDS

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:37.910 line:78%
AFFECTED BY THIS, WERE ASIAN

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:38.878 line:78%
AMERICAN KIDS.

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.046 line:78%
IT'S INTERESTING THEY STOPPED

00:04:38.978 --> 00:04:41.714 line:78%
ADMITTING THEM IN THE NUMBERS

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:42.649 line:78%
THEY HAD PREVIOUSLY.

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:44.917 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Geraldo: I'M PRETTY SURE THIS

00:04:42.749 --> 00:04:46.786 line:78%
HAPPENED TO ME.

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:48.321 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Brian: DID YOU A FULL RIDE TO

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:49.155 line:78%
UCLA BASKETBALL?

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:50.156 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: BECAUSE THE MERIT

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:51.891 line:78%
SCHOLARSHIP DIDN'T COME THROUGH.

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:53.192 line:78%
NOW I HAD TO GO TO MY SECOND

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:54.827 line:78%
SCHOOL, BERKELEY.

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:55.128 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Brian: I'M SORRY TO HEAR

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:57.430 line:78%
THAT.

00:04:55.295 --> 00:04:58.598 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: WHERE DID YOU GO?

00:04:57.597 --> 00:04:59.799 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Brian: I DIDN'T GO.

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:01.034 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DIDN'T THINK SO.

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:03.670 line:78%
ACTIVISTS WANT EVERYBODY, THE

00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:08.741 line:78%
CASUAL OBSERVER, TO REPLACE THE

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:12.645 line:78%
WORD "EQUALITY" WITH" EQUITY."

00:05:08.841 --> 00:05:15.615 line:78%
BEGINS WITH E-Q-U.

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:17.183 line:78%
YOU HEAR MORE ABOUT QUALITY AND

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:18.418 line:78%
LESS THAN EQUITY.

00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:20.186 line:78%
YOU ASKED SOMEBODY WHAT DOES

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:21.721 line:78%
EQUITY MEAN, AND THEY'LL USE A

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:23.790 line:78%
TERMINOLOGY FOR QUALITY

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:24.557 line:78%
EQUALITY, BUT IT'S NOT THE SAME.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.458 line:78%
IT'S IMPORTANT THAT PEOPLE

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:25.892 line:78%
UNDERSTAND WHAT THE DIFFERENCE

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:27.994 line:78%
IS.

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:30.063 line:78%
ONE IS ABOUT PEACE AND THE OTHER

00:05:28.795 --> 00:05:31.164 line:78%
IS ABOUT WAR.

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:32.632 line:78%
EQUALITY IS DEFINED AS PEOPLE

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:36.336 line:78%
HAVING THE SAME OPPORTUNITIES TO

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:41.541 line:78%
ACHIEVE THE SAME GOALS.

00:05:36.436 --> 00:05:42.275 line:78%
WE'RE ALL AT THE SAME STARTING

00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:44.444 line:78%
PLACE.

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:46.079 line:78%
EQUITY IS WE ENFORCE LIMITS ON

00:05:44.544 --> 00:05:47.313 line:78%
ACHIEVEMENT SO NO ONE ACHIEVES

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:48.448 line:78%
MORE THAN ANYONE ELSE.

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:48.781 line:78%
THAT PUNISHES THE REALLY HARD

00:05:48.548 --> 00:05:49.849 line:78%
WORKERS.

00:05:48.881 --> 00:05:51.684 line:78%
THAT LEADS TO WAR.

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:53.519 line:78%
THAT'S SOCIALISM.

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:55.355 line:78%
SO EQUITY -- EQUALITY GIVES

00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:56.622 line:78%
EVERYBODY A STEP UP.

00:05:55.455 --> 00:05:58.958 line:78%
EQUITY CRUSHES FROM ABOVE.

00:05:56.723 --> 00:06:00.093 line:78%
YOU HAVE TO REMEMBER -- WE HAVE

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:01.127 line:78%
TO REMIND YOURSELF OF THIS,

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:02.161 line:78%
WHENEVER YOU RUN INTO THIS

00:06:01.227 --> 00:06:04.297 line:78%
SITUATION, BECAUSE PEOPLE ARE

00:06:02.261 --> 00:06:08.167 line:78%
GOING TO ALWAYS TRY TO REPLACE

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:10.870 line:78%
EQUALITY WITH EQUITY, AND YOU

00:06:08.267 --> 00:06:13.106 line:78%
CAN SEE IT, LIKE IN NEWS

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.140 line:78%
REPORTS, THEY'LL LET THE WORD

00:06:13.206 --> 00:06:15.608 line:78%
"EQUITY" FLY BY.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:19.078 line:78%
THAT'S AN EVIL WORD.

00:06:15.742 --> 00:06:19.212 line:78%
IT IS A WORD THAT CAUSED

00:06:19.178 --> 00:06:19.212 line:78%
COMM

